hadiths[33]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1765","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek safar mein nikle jismein logon ko sakhti pahunchi, phir Abdullah bin Ubayy ne apne sathiyon se kaha: Un par kharch na karo jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hain yahan tak ke wo un ke gird se bikhar jayein, aur kaha: Agar hum Madina wapas aaye to izzat wala zaleel ko zaroor nikalega, phir main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di, phir Aap ne Abdullah bin Ubayy ki taraf bheja aur us se poocha, phir us ne qasam khai ke us ne aisa na kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se jhoot kaha, phir un ki baat se mere dil mein sakhti waqe hui yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ne (sura Iza Jaakal Munafiqun mein) meri tasdeeq nazil farmayi, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe bulaya taake un ke liye istighfar karein, phir unhon ne apne sar mod liye, aur Us ka qaul (khushub musannada) ke bare mein kaha: Wo mard they, sab se khubsurat cheez."
"1766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Abdullah bin Ubayy ke paas us ke dafn ke baad tashreef laye, phir use nikala aur us mein apne luaab se phunka aur use apni qamees pehnayi."
"1767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Ubayy jab faut hua to us ka beta Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe apni qamees dijiye taake main use us mein kafan dun, aur us par namaz parhiye aur us ke liye istighfar kijiye, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use apni qamees di, phir Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe ittila do taake main us par namaz parhun, phir us ne ittila di, phir jab Aap ne us par namaz parhne ka irada kiya to Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Aap ko kheench liya aur kaha: Kya Allah ne Aap ko munafiqon par namaz parhne se mana nahi kiya? To Aap ne farmaya: Main do bhalaiyon ke darmiyan hun, Aap ne (ye ayat) kahi: (Tum un ke liye istighfar karo ya un ke liye istighfar na karo, agar tum un ke liye sattar martaba istighfar karoge to Allah unhe kabhi na bakhshega), phir Aap ne us par namaz parhi, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Aur un mein se kisi par kabhi namaz na parho jo mar jaye)."
"1768","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Baitullah ke paas do Quraishi aur ek Saqafi, ya do Saqafi aur ek Quraishi jama hue, un ke peton ki charbi bahut aur dilon ki samajh thodi thi, phir un mein se ek ne kaha: Kya tum samajhte ho ke Allah sunta hai jo hum kehte hain? Doosre ne kaha: Sunta hai agar hum buland kahein, aur nahi sunta agar hum chhupayein, aur doosre ne kaha: Agar wo sunta hai jab hum buland kehte hain to wo sunta hai jab hum chhupate hain, phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Aur tum chhupte na they ke tumhare khilaf tumhare kaan, aankhein aur khaalein gawahi dein) aakhir ayat tak."
"1769","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Uhud ki taraf nikle to Aap ke sahaba mein se kuch log wapas aaye, phir ek giroh ne kaha: Hum unhe qatal karenge, aur ek giroh ne kaha: Hum unhe qatal na karenge, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Phir tumhe munafiqon mein do giroh kyun ho gaye)."
"1770","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein munafiqon mein se kuch mard they ke jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghazwe ki taraf nikalte to wo Aap se peeche reh jate aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peeche apne baithne par khush hote, phir jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef late to Aap se uzr karte aur qasmein khate aur pasand karte ke un ki hamd ki jaye us par jo unhon ne na kiya, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Wo na samjhein jo khush hote hain) aakhir ayat tak."
"1771","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se Alqama bin Waqqas ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Marwan ne apne darban se kaha: Jao Ae Rafi! Ibn Abbas ke paas jao aur kaho: Agar har shakhs jo us par khush hua jo use diya gaya aur pasand kare ke us ki hamd ki jaye us par jo us ne na kiya azab diya jayega to hum sab zaroor azab diye jayenge, phir Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Tumhe is se kya? Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Yahud ko bulaya aur un se ek cheez poochi, phir unhon ne use Aap se chhupaya aur Aap ko us ke siwa khabar di, phir unhon ne Aap ko dikhaya ke unhon ne Aap se us par tareef hasil ki jo unhon ne Aap ko us ke bare mein khabar di jismein Aap ne un se poocha tha, aur wo khush hue us par jo unhe un ke chhupane se diya gaya, phir Ibn Abbas ne (ye ayat) parhi: (Aur jab Allah ne un logon se ehad liya jinhe kitab di gayi) isi tarah is qaul tak: (khush hote hain us par jo unhon ne kiya aur pasand karte hain ke un ki hamd ki jaye us par jo unhon ne na kiya)."
"1772","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nasrani tha phir musalman hua aur Baqara aur Aal Imran parhi, phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye likhta tha, phir wo Nasrani ho gaya aur kehta tha: Muhammad sirf wahi janta hai jo main ne us ke liye likha, phir Allah ne use maut di aur unhon ne use dafn kiya, phir subah hui aur zameen ne use bahar nikal phenka, phir unhon ne kaha: Ye Muhammad aur us ke sahaba ka kaam hai, jab wo un se bhaga to unhon ne hamare sathi ko nikala aur phenk diya, phir unhon ne us ke liye khoda aur gehra kiya, phir subah hui aur zameen ne use bahar nikal phenka, phir unhon ne kaha: Ye Muhammad aur us ke sahaba ka kaam hai, unhon ne hamare sathi ko nikala jab wo un se bhaga aur phenk diya, phir unhon ne us ke liye khoda aur zameen mein jitna ho saka gehra kiya, phir subah hui aur zameen ne use bahar nikal phenka, phir unhon ne jan liya ke wo logon mein se nahi hai, phir unhon ne use phenk diya."
"1773","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Qayamat ke din bada mote jism wala shakhs aayega jo Allah ke paas machhar ke par ke barabar wazan na rakhega, aur farmaya: Parho: (Phir hum Qayamat ke din un ke liye wazan na rakhenge)."
"1774","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahud ke ulama mein se ek aalim Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Muhammad! Beshak hum pate hain ke Allah aasmanon ko ek ungli par rakhta hai, aur zameeno ko ek ungli par, aur darakhton ko ek ungli par, aur pani aur mitti ko ek ungli par, aur baqi makhlooq ko ek ungli par, phir kehta hai: Main badshah hun, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki dadhein zahir ho gayein, us aalim ki baat ki tasdeeq karte hue, phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne (ye ayat) parhi: (Aur unhon ne Allah ki qadar na ki jaisi Us ki qadar ka haq hai, aur zameen sab Qayamat ke din Us ki mutthi mein hogi, aur aasman Us ke dayan haath mein lapete jayenge, Wo paak hai aur buland hai us se jo wo shareek karte hain)."
"1775","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah zameen ko pakdega aur aasman ko apne dayan haath se lapetega, phir farmayega: Main badshah hun, zameen ke badshah kahan hain?"
"1776","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Qayamat ke din zameen ko pakdega aur aasman Us ke dayan haath mein honge, phir farmayega: Main badshah hun."
"1777","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Saad (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Log Qayamat ke din safed surkhi mayel zameen par jama kiye jayenge, jaise khalis aate ki roti, us mein kisi ke liye koi nishan na hoga."
"1778","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zameen Qayamat ke din ek roti hogi, Jabbar use apne haath se ultega jaise tum mein se ek safar mein apni roti ulta hai, Jannat walon ke liye tohfa, phir Yahud mein se ek shakhs aaya aur kaha: Rahman tumhe barkat de Ae Abul Qasim! Kya main tumhe Jannat walon ke tohfe ki khabar na dun Qayamat ke din? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, us ne kaha: Zameen ek roti hogi jaise Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamari taraf dekha phir hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki dadhein zahir ho gayein, phir farmaya: Kya main tumhe un ke salan ki khabar na dun? Us ne kaha: Un ka salan balam aur noon hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Bail aur machhli, un dono ke kaleje ke zaid hisse se sattar hazar khayenge."
"1779","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Agar Yahud mein se dus mujh par iman late to Yahud mujh par iman le aate."
"1780","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Madina ke veeran mein chal raha tha aur Aap apne sath khajoor ki tehni par tek lagaye they, phir Yahud ke ek giroh ke paas se guzre, phir un mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: Us se Ruh ke bare mein poocho, aur baaz ne kaha: Us se na poocho, wo us mein koi aisi cheez na laye jo tum napasand karte ho, phir baaz ne kaha: Hum us se zaroor poochenge, phir un mein se ek shakhs khada hua aur kaha: Ae Abul Qasim! Ruh kya hai? To Aap khamosh rahe, phir main ne kaha: Aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai, phir main khada hua, phir jab Aap se wo door hui to farmaya: (Aur wo tum se Ruh ke bare mein poochhte hain, kaho Ruh mere Rab ke hukm se hai, aur tumhe ilm mein se bahut kam diya gaya hai)."
"1781","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khabbab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main jahiliyyat mein lohar tha aur mera Aas bin Wail par qarz tha, phir main us ke paas taqaza karne aaya, us ne kaha: Main tumhe na dunga yahan tak ke tum Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kufr karo, phir main ne kaha: Main kufr na karunga yahan tak ke Allah tumhe maut de phir tum uthaye jao, us ne kaha: Mujhe chhor do yahan tak ke main marun aur uthaya jaun, phir mujhe maal aur aulad di jayegi aur main tumhara qarz ada karunga, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Kya tune us ko dekha jis ne hamari ayaton se kufr kiya aur kaha mujhe zaroor maal aur aulad di jayegi, kya us ne ghaib dekha ya Rahman ke paas ehad liya hai)."
"1782","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jahl ne kaha: Ae Allah! Agar yehi Haq hai Tere paas se to hum par aasman se pathar barsa ya hamein dardnak azab de, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Aur Allah unhe azab dene wala na tha jabke tum un mein ho, aur Allah unhe azab dene wala na tha jabke wo istighfar karte hain, aur unhe kya ke Allah unhe azab na de jabke wo Masjid Haram se rokte hain) aakhir ayat tak."
"1783","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye sirf is liye hua ke Quraish jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par sarkash hue to Aap ne un par Yusuf ke saalon jaise saalon ki dua ki, phir unhe qehet aur sakhti pahunchi yahan tak ke wo haddiyan khate they, phir shakhs aasman ki taraf dekhta aur apne aur us ke darmiyan sakhti se dhuein jaisi surat dekhta, phir Allah Taala ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Phir intezar karo jis din aasman wazeh dhuan layega jo logon ko dhankega, ye dardnak azab hai), unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya gaya aur kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Mudar ke liye Allah se pani mangiye, phir beshak wo halak ho gaye, Aap ne farmaya: Mudar ke liye, beshak tum jaree ho, phir Aap ne pani manga aur unhe pani diya gaya, phir (ye ayat) nazil hui: (Beshak tum wapas aane wale ho), phir jab unhe khushhali pahunchi to wo apne haal ki taraf wapas aaye jab unhe khushhali pahunchi, phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne (ye ayat) nazil farmayi: (Jis din hum badi pakad pakdenge, beshak hum badla lene wale hain), unhon ne kaha: Yaani Badr ka din."
"1784","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Chand Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein do tukdon mein phat gaya, phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Gawah raho."
"1785","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Makkah walon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se manga ke unhe nishani dikhayein, phir Aap ne unhe chand ka phatna dikhaya."
"1786","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke chand Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein phat gaya."
"1787","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Koi shakhs ya koi cheez us aza par sabr karne wali nahi jo wo sunta hai, jitna Allah hai, beshak wo Us ke liye beta pukarte hain, jabke Wo unhe sehat deta hai aur rizq deta hai."
"1788","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se marfooan riwayat hai ke Allah Dozakh walon mein se sab se halke azab wale se farmayega: Agar tere liye zameen mein jo kuch hai hota to kya tu us se fidya deta? Wo kahega: Haan, Wo farmayega: Main ne tum se is se aasan ka sawal kiya tha jab tum Adam ki peeth mein they, ke mere sath shirk na karna, phir tune shirk ke siwa inkar kiya."
"1789","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Nabiyallah! Kafir Qayamat ke din apne chehre par jama kiya jayega? Aap ne farmaya: Kya Wo jis ne use duniya mein do paon par chalaya, is par qadir nahi ke use Qayamat ke din us ke chehre par chalaye? Qatada (Anas se hadith ke rawi) ne kaha: Haan hamare Rab ki izzat ki qasam."
"1790","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ki narm tehni jaisi hai, jahan se hawa aaye use jhuka deti hai, phir jab seedhi ho to bala se jhukti hai, aur fajir sanaubar jaisa hai, sakht seedha, yahan tak ke Allah use tod de jab chahe."
"1791","[AI-translation] Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ki narm tehni jaisi hai, hawa use kabhi jhukati hai aur kabhi seedha karti hai, aur munafiq ki misaal sanaubar jaisi hai, wo barabar rehta hai yahan tak ke us ka ukhadna ek martaba ho."
"1792","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak darakhton mein ek darakht hai jis ke patte nahi girte, aur beshak wo musalman ki misaal hai, phir mujhe batao wo kya hai? To log jungle ke darakhton mein pad gaye (Abdullah ne kaha): Aur mere dil mein aaya ke wo khajoor hai, phir main sharmaya, phir unhon ne kaha: Hamein bataiye wo kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Wo khajoor hai."
"1793","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko us ka amal kabhi nijat na dega, unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ko bhi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aur mujhe bhi, magar ye ke Allah mujhe rehmat se dhank le, seedhe raho."
"1794","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Seedhe raho, qareeb raho aur khushkhabri lo, phir beshak kisi ko us ka amal Jannat mein dakhil na karega, unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ko bhi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aur mujhe bhi, magar ye ke Allah mujhe maghfirat aur rehmat se dhank le."
"1795","[AI-translation] Hazrat al-Mughira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz parhne ke liye khade hote yahan tak ke Aap ke qadam ya pindliyan sooj jatein, phir Aap se kaha jata to Aap farmate: Kya main shukr guzar banda na banun?"
"1796","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (raziyallahu anhu) har Jumeraat ko logon ko naseehat karte they, phir ek shakhs ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Kaash tum hamein har din naseehat karte, unhon ne kaha: Raha ye ke mujhe is se wo rokta hai ke main napasand karta hun ke tumhe ukta dun, aur beshak main tumhe naseehat ke sath waqf karta hun jaise Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamein us se waqf farmate they, hum par uktahat ke dar se."
"1797","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aag khwahishon se dhanki gayi hai, aur Jannat napasand cheezon se dhanki gayi hai."
